42 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 83 0 R/E(The Joint Technical Committee of IEC and ISO on information technology \(ISO/IEC JTC1\) prepares international standards which contribute towards AI. )/Pg 9 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

43 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 84 0 R/E(A subcommittee on AI \(ISO/IEC JTC 1/SC42\), was set up in 2017. )/Pg 9 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

44 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 85 0 R/E(ISO/IEC JTC1/SC7, which covers software and system engineering, has published a technical report on the \215Testing of AI-based systems\216 )/Pg 9 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

45 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 86 0 R/E(The EU-wide General Data Protection Regulation \(GDPR\) came into effect in May 2018 and sets obligations for data controllers with regards to personal data and automated decision-making.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

46 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 87 0 R/E(GDPR includes requirements to assess and improve AI system functional performance, including the mitigation of potential discrimination, and for ensuring individuals rights are not subjected to automated decision-making. )/Pg 9 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

47 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 88 0 R/E(The most important aspect of the GDPR from a testing perspective is that personal data \(including predictions\) should be accurate. )/Pg 9 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

