55 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 92 0 R/T(Where AI is used in safety-related systems, the relevant regulatory standards are applicable, such as ISO 26262 and ISO/PAS 21448 \(SOTIF\) for automotive systems. )/E(Where AI is used in safety-related systems, the relevant regulatory standards are applicable, such as ISO 26262 and ISO/PAS 21448 \(SOTIF\) for automotive systems. )/Pg 10 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

56 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 93 0 R/T(Such regulatory standards are typically mandated by government bodies, and it would be illegal to sell a car in some countries if the included software did not comply with ISO 26262.)/E(Such regulatory standards are typically mandated by government bodies, and it would be illegal to sell a car in some countries if the included software did not comply with ISO 26262.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[6]>>
